WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:06.320
Hello, did you hear the news?&nbsp;
“DALL-E 2 has a secret language”!

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:13.360
If one lets DALLE-2 generate an image from&nbsp;
"Apoploe vesrreaitais", it will generate birds.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:18.240
"Contarra ccetnxniams luryca&nbsp;
tanniounons" generates bugs or pests.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.040
Ms. Coffee Bean, are you drunk?

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.880
In this video, we will discuss what the&nbsp;
discoverers of this phenomenon have told us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:32.880
on Twitter and in their arXiv paper about this.&nbsp;
We will see what theories the community has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:38.720
come up with to explain how DALLE-2 can&nbsp;
generate sensible output from gibberish.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:45.920
And we will realize that we should guard ourselves&nbsp;
from the incoming flood of clickbait headlines,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:51.280
because spoilers, but no: DALL-E&nbsp;
2 does not have an own “language”.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:56.640
Language or not, DALL-E 2’s gibberish&nbsp;
is an interesting phenomenon to look at,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.480
nonetheless, so let’s discuss&nbsp;
this in an AI Coffee Break!

